description 1 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/1".

description 1 has the type "iopa:BindingRequirement".

description 1 is a legal rule.

description 1 has the label "Article 11".

description 1 has for "iopa:affects" the resource interop 1.

description 1 has for "cav:valueDescription" the value "Exchanges of information between home and host competent authorities should be made faster, allowing closer coordination including, where appropriate, through the involvement of the European Insurance and Occupational Pensions Authority (‘EIOPA’). Member States shall ensure that all procedures and formalities relating to cross-border activities and procedures can be easily completed through electronic means".

description 1 has the time specification description 1 time.

