description 2 has the description "Where pension tracking systems are in place, Member States shall ensure that insurance undertakings and insurance intermediaries transmit to pension tracking systems, where such system have been established, all information necessary to provide customers with a comprehensive, reliable and up-to-date overview of their personal and occupational entitlements".


description 2 time is a temporal specification.

