description 3 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/3".

description 3 has the type "iopa:BindingRequirement".

description 3 is a legal rule.

description 3 has the label "Article 37a".

description 3 has for "iopa:affects" the resource interop 2.

description 3 has for "cav:valueDescription" the value "Member States shall ensure that IORPs transmit to pension tracking systems, where such system have been established, all information necessary to provide members and beneficiaries with a comprehensive, reliable and up-to-date overview of their occupational and personal pension entitlements. IORPs remain fully responsible for the completeness and accuracy of the data transmitted and for the fulfilment of all communication obligations. The format and structure of the information to be transmitted to pension tracking systems shall, to the maximum extent possible, ensure alignment with Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/473".

description 3 has the time specification description 3 time.

description 3 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/842/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_842/FINAL/eng/art_37".

description 3 has the digital dimension data.

description 3 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 3 involves the process transmission of information.

description 3 produces action 1.

description 3 produces item 3 action.

description 3 references information necessary to provide members beneficiaries with a comprehensive.

description 3 has the description "Member States shall ensure that IORPs transmit to pension tracking systems, where such system have been established, all information necessary to provide members and beneficiaries with a comprehensive, reliable and up-to-date overview of their occupational and personal pension entitlements. IORPs remain fully responsible for the completeness and accuracy of the data transmitted and for the fulfilment of all communication obligations. The format and structure of the information to be transmitted to pension tracking systems shall, to the maximum extent possible, ensure alignment with Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/473".


description 3 time is a temporal specification.

description 3 time has the function validity.


description 4 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/4".

description 4 has the type "iopa:BindingRequirement".

description 4 is a legal rule.

description 4 has the label "Article 55a".

description 4 has for "iopa:affects" the resource interop 1.

description 4 has for "cav:valueDescription" the value "EIOPA may, on its own initiative or at the request of one or more of the relevant competent authorities, set up and coordinate a collaboration platform to strengthen the exchange of information and to enhance collaboration between the relevant competent authorities where an IORP carries out, or intends to carry out, cross-border activities. The relevant competent authorities shall provide all necessary information in a timely manner".

description 4 has the time specification description 4 time.

description 4 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/842/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_842/FINAL/eng/art_55".

